+<h2 id="shath-yar">Shath'Yar Constructed Sentences</h2>
+
+<p>Based on the grammar in <a href="shath-yar/grammar.md">shath-yar/grammar.md</a>.
+Key patterns used: Apostrophe as morpheme boundary; *N'-* prefix (negation/absence);
+*-oth* name-forming suffix; *-i* plural/agency suffix; reduplication for emphasis.
+Shath'Yar has <strong>extremely limited attestation</strong> — only proper names and
+a few untranslated phrases. All constructions below combine attested morphemes and
+phrase fragments with minimal assumptions.</p>
+
+<table>
+<tr><th>#</th><th>Sentence</th><th>IPA</th><th>Gloss</th><th>Grammar Used</th></tr>
+
