+  <td>N'Zoth, Il'gynoth.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/ˈnɑːzɒθ ɪlˈɡɪnɒθ/</td>
+  <td>N'Zoth, Heart of Corruption.</td>
+  <td>Attested *N'Zoth* + attested *Il'gynoth* (heart + corruption); juxtaposition of two confirmed Old God/servant names</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>SY2</td>
+  <td>Ywaq maq ywaq, K'thir.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/jwɑːk mɑːk jwɑːk kəˈθɪr/</td>
+  <td>[Unknown emphasis], servants.</td>
+  <td>Attested phrase *ywaq maq ywaq* (showing reduplication) + attested *K'thir* (servants); <strong>speculative</strong> — assumes the attested phrase can serve as a command or statement directed at the K'thir</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
