 <h3 id="ia-suffix">The *-ia* / *-a* Feminine Suffix</h3>
 
-<p>Three confirmed female Haranir names end in <span class="inferred">*-ia*</span> or phonologically conditioned variants:</p>
+<p>Three confirmed female Haranir names end in <span class="inferred">*-ia*</span> or phonologically conditioned variants, plus a fourth name with the <span class="inferred">*-neia*</span> ending:</p>
 
