+<h2 id="gutterspeak">Gutterspeak (Forsaken) Constructed Sentences</h2>
+
+<p>Based on the grammar in <a href="gutterspeak/grammar.md">gutterspeak/grammar.md</a>.
+Gutterspeak is <strong>identical to Common in grammar</strong> (confirmed by lore). The Forsaken speak
+Common with archaic, morbid, and culturally specific lexical substitutions. No distinct Gutterspeak
+vocabulary or syntax is attested. The sentences below demonstrate how Forsaken speech patterns might
+differ pragmatically from living Common speakers, using <strong>only Common syntax with inferred
+Forsaken register features</strong>.</p>
+
