+  <td>For the Forsaken, we endure.</td>
+  <td>Attested self-designation <em>Forsaken</em> + Common prepositional phrase + SVO; <strong>high confidence</strong> — sentiment consistent with Forsaken characterization</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>Gs3</td>
+  <td>The Plague takes all; death is mercy.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/ðə pleɪg teɪks ɔl dɛθ ɪz ˈmɜrsi/</td>
+  <td>The Plague takes all; death is mercy.</td>
