 <tr class="new"><td>Decimus</td><td class="ipa">/ˈdɛsɪməs/</td><td>Domanaar general</td><td>Latin-inspired name ("tenth"); possibly Common-language rendering, not Shath'Yar. Captured by Alleria and Arator; informs them about Nexus-Points and Salhadaar. Seemingly betrayed the party by allowing Terminas to capture them, but the distraction allowed Decimus to steal the Mantle of Predation before killing Terminas</td></tr>
 <tr class="new"><td>Terminas</td><td class="ipa">/ˈtɜːrmɪnəs/</td><td>Most powerful domanaar</td><td>Latin-inspired name; possibly Common-language rendering. Possessed the Mantle of Predation. Captured Alleria's party; killed by Decimus who stole the Mantle</td></tr>
 <tr class="new"><td>L'ura</td><td class="ipa">/ˈluːrə/</td><td>Dark naaru</td><td>Shath'Yar-style initial-apostrophe name (<span class="inferred">*L'*</span> + *-ura*). Originally a naaru aboard the Xenedar in Mac'Aree (Argus, Legion); corrupted by the Void. Absorbed into Alleria Windrunner during the Argus campaign. Released by Xal'atath during the Midnight Voidspire confrontation; fired a void beam into the Sunwell, corrupting it into the Darkwell. Destroyed at the Darkwell</td></tr>
