38-<h1>Nature / Druidic Vocabulary</h1>
39-
40-<p>This document compiles vocabulary related to druidic communication, nature spirits, and the
41-"language of the wild" in World of Warcraft. Unlike other languages in this collection,
42-"Nature" or "Druidic" is <strong>not a constructed language</strong> with attested words — it
43-is a communication system between druids, nature spirits, and the natural world.</p>
44-
