35-
36-<p>Grammar rules below are <strong>inferred from attested examples only</strong>. The Ethereal language has no attested sentences — the entire corpus consists of proper names, place names, and faction designations spanning <em>The Burning Crusade</em> (2007), <em>Shadowlands</em> (2020), and <em>The War Within</em> (2024–2026). Patterns are noted where multiple examples support a rule. Speculative extensions are marked <span class="uncertain">[speculative]</span>.</p>
